Z||000000||Oreif||07-07-2000||07:08 PM||||Had a run in with some idiot in a Galant VR4. Due to the volume of traffic he kept ending up cutting me off. Finally I decided not to let him in the lane. We'll this moron was getting upset that I was pacing next to him so he could not pass the guy in front. As we came upon a ramp from one highway to the next I sped up and jumped onto the ramp. Well little rice boy decides he's going to ride my bumper. I hit the gas and so did he.<BR>He was doing good up to about 75mph when he suddenly realized his car wasn't designed for high speed cornering and he slammed on his brakes. Guess who ended up in the ditch? Not Me!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>(He didn't hurt himself but the car needs some front end work now.)<BR>Don't you just love increasing radius ramps?<P><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-08-2000).]||||reg||1
